". Vidjela sam to izbliza. Član obitelji mog dečka i njegova supruga dugo nisu mogli začeti, a nakon 30 dana zajedničkog posta i molitve napokon je došla trudnoća. To mi govori nešto snažno: tijelo ima": ". I've seen it up close. A member of my boyfriend's family and his wife couldn't conceive for a long time, and after 30 days of fasting and praying together, a pregnancy finally came. That tells me something powerful: the body has an",
"NEVJEROJATNU": "INCREDIBLE",
"sposobnost ozdravljenja čim maknemo ono što ga ometa i damo mu prave uvjete, podršku i vjeru. Ne dijelim ovo zato da bih rekla da je dugi post jedini put niti da bih te uplašila, nego da te ohrabrim da svaki dan biraš ono što ti je dobro i da nikad ne zaboraviš koliko je tvoje tijelo": "ability to heal as soon as we remove what's getting in its way and give it the right conditions, support and faith. I'm not sharing this to say that a long fast is the only way or to scare you, but to encourage you to choose what's good for you every day and to never forget how",
