"Temperatura u mirovanju niža je u folikularnoj fazi, a nakon ovulacije poraste za 0,2 do 0,5 stupnjeva zbog progesterona. Ako je mjeriš svako jutro prije ustajanja i zapisuješ, vidjet ćeš da se ovulacija dogodila. Ovulacija nije važna samo za plodnost, nego i za zdrav libido i prirodnu proizvodnju hormona. Bez nje tijelo ništa od toga ne može u potpunosti podržati.": "Your resting temperature is lower in the follicular phase, and after ovulation it rises by 0.2 to 0.5 degrees Celsius because of progesterone. If you measure it every morning before getting up and write it down, you'll see that ovulation has happened. Ovulation isn't only important for fertility, but also for a healthy libido and natural hormone production. Without it, your body can't fully support any of that.",
"💊 Kontracepcija i tvoj prirodni ciklus": "💊 Birth control and your natural cycle",
"Dok uzimaš pilulu, ne ovuliraš, pa tvoje tijelo ne stvara vlastite prirodne hormone. Cervikalna sluz je potisnuta, a BTT ostaje ravna.": "While you're on the pill, you don't ovulate, so your body doesn't make its own natural hormones. Cervical mucus is suppressed and your BBT stays flat.",
"Pilula ima niz nuspojava o kojima se premalo govori: promjene raspoloženja i libida, lošije zdravlje crijeva, manjak nutrijenata i dugoročnu hormonsku neravnotežu. Mnoge se žene na piluli osjećaju prazno, odvojeno od sebe, kao da to nisu one, a nikad to ne povežu s pilulom.": "The pill has a number of side effects that aren't talked about enough: changes in mood and libido, poorer gut health, nutrient deficiencies and long-term hormonal imbalance. Many women on the pill feel empty, disconnected from themselves, like they're not themselves, and never connect it to the pill.",
"Ako je sada uzimaš i razmišljaš o tome da prestaneš, savjetujem ti da to napraviš polako i uz dobru podršku. Daj tijelu vremena da se ponovno probudi, jer prirodnom ciklusu može trebati od 3 do 6 mjeseci, a nekad i duže, da se vrati. Sve u ovom programu tu je da ti u tome pomogne. Kreni od uzroka svojih tegoba i pusti tijelo da radi prirodno, onako kako je oduvijek trebalo, bez sintetike koja ga ometa. Vjeruj mi, osjećat ćeš se bolje nego ikad.": "If you're taking it now and thinking about stopping, I'd advise you to do it slowly and with good support. Give your body time to wake back up, because your natural cycle can take 3 to 6 months, sometimes longer, to return. Everything in this program is here to help you with that. Start with the causes of your symptoms and let your body work naturally, the way it was always meant to, without synthetics getting in its way. Trust me, you'll feel better than ever.",
"🎀 Važno je što nosiš, osobito donje rublje": "🎀 What you wear matters, especially underwear",
"Rijetko razmišljamo o odjeći kao o dijelu zdravlja, a tkanine koje cijeli dan dodiruju naša najosjetljivija mjesta zaslužuju pažnju. Donje rublje i grudnjak satima su u izravnom dodiru s osjetljivom kožom, svaki dan.": "We rarely think of clothing as part of our health, yet the fabrics that touch our most sensitive areas all day deserve attention. Underwear and bras are in direct contact with sensitive skin for hours, every day.",
"Sintetske tkanine poput": "Synthetic fabrics like",
"poliestera, najlona i elastina": "polyester, nylon and elastane",
"ne dišu. Zadržavaju toplinu i vlagu, nose kemijske boje i premaze te stvaraju sitne elektrostatske naboje uz samu kožu. U istraživanju dr. Ahmeda Shafika životinje koje su nosile poliester s vremenom su postale manje plodne, a on je to povezao upravo s elektrostatskim poljem sintetskih vlakana.": "don't breathe. They trap heat and moisture, carry chemical dyes and coatings and create tiny electrostatic charges right against your skin. In research by Dr. Ahmed Shafik, animals that wore polyester became less fertile over time, and he linked this specifically to the electrostatic field of synthetic fibers.",
"Nosi prirodna vlakna koja dišu": "Wear natural, breathable fibers",
"Biraj": "Choose",
